{"resourceIdentifier":"647","resourceName":"Boden Creek Ecological Preserve Forest Carbon Project","description":"This REDD+ project is located on The Boden Creek Ecological Preserve (5213 ha), a private reserve located in southern Belize. The property was purchased in 1998 because of its strategic position as a critical biological corridor link between the terrestrial and the marine environments and because of its conservation importance.  It is validated and verified under VCS. The core objective of this project is to commercialize the forest carbon offsets at the Boden Creek Ecological Preserve near Punta Gorda, Belize, Central America.  This property has been the site of a groundbreaking effort to use ecotourism as a funding source for land preservation.  Due to the global economic downturn it is imperative that additional funding sources be secured to stabilize the operation.  This land is currently under immediate threat of land conversion for agriculture, and it contains documented populations of internationally protected biodiversity.","location":{"latitude":16.309633,"longitude":-88.793452},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"647"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Toledo District"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Boden Creek Ecological Preserve"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"647"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"647"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"57718"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":29951}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATER